sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: GET /chargewire
  S-->>C: 200 discovery: capabilities, auth.grant_types
  C->>S: POST /chargewire/v1/auth/token<br/>{"grant_type": "password", "username", "password"}
  alt credentials verify
    S-->>C: 200 {"access_token", "token_type": "Bearer", "expires_in"}
  else they don't
    S-->>C: 401 invalid_credentials (never says which part)
  end
  C->>S: any other request<br/>Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
  S-->>C: the answer, or 401 invalid_token (+ reason for a token it issued)
